  "markdown": {
    "instructions": "StackNext documentation is written for developers using StackNext in a Next.js App Router project. Use the getting-started and guides sections to install and operate the product, and the reference section for CLI, configuration, MCP and package surfaces. Version-matched package API reference ships inside each npm package under node_modules/@stacknext/<package>/docs/ and is preferred over this site for installed-version APIs. Diagnostic findings are evidence, not confirmed root causes; regression comparisons are deterministic and report-only. Contributor and repository-maintenance documentation is not part of this site."
  }
